{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/89002e54e46e5d1ec526c3777b6d6cca.poster.avif?t=1755824921\" width=712 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/89002e54e46e5d1ec526c3777b6d6cca.webm?t=1755824921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/89002e54e46e5d1ec526c3777b6d6cca.mp4?t=1755824921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What awaits you?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HARVESTED</strong> is a horror game in which you need to escape using items scattered around the map as you progress through the story.\u00a0But be careful, you're not completely alone here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and utilize!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use items to unlock new areas of the map</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete required objectives</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open the main door and escape!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/184a93c95a94a3beb31093d4e0962a3a.poster.avif?t=1755824921\" width=710 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/184a93c95a94a3beb31093d4e0962a3a.webm?t=1755824921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/184a93c95a94a3beb31093d4e0962a3a.mp4?t=1755824921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How is this concept not boring?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many unique entities to face</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Many random events that keep you on your toes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All items and structures needed to escape are randomized each run</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lot of achievements and trophies</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/3c68f390c5237a176207f140abbab147.poster.avif?t=1755824921\" width=712 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/3c68f390c5237a176207f140abbab147.webm?t=1755824921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/3c68f390c5237a176207f140abbab147.mp4?t=1755824921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/2aeea3ebec1d39a8fc06ad9d83960165.avif?t=1755824921\" data-has-big width=800 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/a78562f65a5bd0e3a682d4528647592a.webp?t=1755824921\" width=600 height=18 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lucky One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steam